) 하는 거라고 느낄수도 있겠지만 그렇지는 않아요. 저도 매번 새 업체를 할때마다 여러 장애물을 겪습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-106473a3-5e2f-4643-94bb-6a2f5d0bee03\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-608d62eb-ecd6-4878-ac74-b51e5f126442\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-349f739e-3130-4f97-8f03-59640fe9e05d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0c2c5787-1536-43e8-bbee-03a79d70e08d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-06dac04e-3d37-4d5d-887c-045237b6aa9e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5ad9b20e-2553-4cba-a5fd-84ab93ecd3a3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3d68fd51-7e67-4978-bd2c-eb7e5dcfee66\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-58e61635-1b83-4953-8093-de836f58d330\">그리고 사내 자료를 엄청 업데이트 합니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1d116683-dbf8-4460-9f72-4ab6968d3b99\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a6e9609e-cc78-45ab-bd70-b6ec4d778287\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-769a6344-a509-43ae-aead-92ba2596242a\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:559px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-769a6344-a509-43ae-aead-92ba2596242a\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA0MTFfODcg/MDAxNzQ0Mzc5Mzg4ODI0.Ft0UKNUr56Qte5w-SRIVQNwtA1FmufkoCGp8b4Xaeacg.m9LlBPdTBxKdRy_5EyYIdBeKzNfyx_9oNhbSbPY-kzsg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"559\", \"originalHeight\" : \"349\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA0MTFfODcg/MDAxNzQ0Mzc5Mzg4ODI0.Ft0UKNUr56Qte5w-SRIVQNwtA1FmufkoCGp8b4Xaeacg.m9LlBPdTBxKdRy_5EyYIdBeKzNfyx_9oNhbSbPY-kzsg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-1c262d7e-423c-4747-bf11-4a90a12b93d4\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d6fefb51-2f0d-470e-9864-a14dcaf6baf5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-74ad9de9-d9a6-477a-9b1f-e48f0e2344ae\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1c81da39-e8b4-4058-8b4c-5d9b5d725d2d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-2a31dbb6-365a-4297-a3f2-f2accd6b3a7e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9164d58e-8cd9-4c14-9de3-f855ef0b95c0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-51089e9a-45eb-45d7-8957-aa155a80e74e\">요즘 일이 많다보니깐 자료 업데이트도 정말 엄청 하고 있습니다. 진짜 시간만 되면 이런것도 강의에 더 업데이트 하고 싶은데 지금 하려는 것도 다 못하고 있어서 너무 슬퍼요ㅠㅠㅠ 틈틈히 해볼게요!!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4883f05d-2d36-480c-8fca-4e01059e2b86\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c015a961-c313-453a-9dc7-7c6d2238fd06\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7dc65e10-2daf-4474-b634-8fb5f0e17185\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9a165a13-a5d6-4935-8d3d-082b2da0cb1e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ee1613b4-03ff-400a-88dc-5bc996f2d7cf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b99d1326-b084-405c-851e-e66afb29bd2e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9cb367d8-3129-40c4-a291-d3b2f70d2377\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6c56e255-8817-495e-9b2b-55e1d4fa0873\">그리고 매번 진짜 고객마다 상황이 다 달라서 하면 할수록 여러분에게 해드리고 싶은 말이 많거든요..... 당연히 다 마케팅과 마케팅으로 돈 버는 이야기에 관한 것입니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0f310a2-de73-4688-9479-5eb3809eba4a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-907ed93f-9736-40de-9586-50b3211d5aae\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-50b7d9e4-7b60-4a93-9835-cb7494102d1c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b94dcad4-9a6a-461b-a02a-de2712e80581\">어떤 이야기를 먼저 쓰는게 좋을까 고민중인데 아래 키워드를 보시고 </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5c01ba30-c05c-49af-9f15-0ee6842a0477\"><u><b>댓글로 번호 </b></u></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f347e37a-39b2-4449-a854-fd7ae1d9de94\">투표해주시면 될때마다 빨리 써보겠습니다. </spa